Ħruġ ikteb: ['Test object'], linja-ġdida.
>> p := Mogħdija /tmp.
Ħruġ ikteb: p, linja-ġdida.
>> old-p-address := p prototip indirizz-memorja.
p save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], linja-ġdida.
>> b := Oġġett load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b prototip indirizz-memorja = old-p-address) veru: {
	Ħruġ ikteb: ['Object link re-attached.'], linja-ġdida.
}.
Ħruġ ikteb: b, linja-ġdida.
